member.param:
Flow-control configuration. 
governs the tick rate; 
controls how many credits are released per widen operation.

member.summary:
Non-blocking credit acquisition. Returns true and deducts
 credits when the window has sufficient capacity;
returns false when the window is exhausted.

Registers the core bidirectional streaming infrastructure, deriving the
 from a functional transform applied to the
default configuration.


Example:

services.AddBidirectionalStreaming(opts => opts with
{
    Mode = FlowControlMode.Adaptive,
    InitialWindowSize = 128
});
